{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Rockman wearily looks around, as if looking for hope. He looks to his wife in the blankets and sighs sadly \"I feel... That I am failing everyone, that i am failing you\"... He sits motionless beside her","created_at":"2020-08-13T07:32:26.702000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743371373866385460","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf sits for a few more minutes. The wind softly ruffles through some of her tree's leaves and she's reminded of something. The night she talked to Web and finally learned more about what had happened to them. The Golden Dawn... Just a week ago she told herself... Leaf suddenly stands. She repeats what she said that night to the open air. She starts out shakily, but it progressively gets more calm. \"My name is Leaf. I am a called goblin of the Wild Mother and best friend to Mello. No lies or secret plots can take that away, and nothing I ever do will change that truth.\" She pauses and turns back to look at Rockman, not quite smiling, but hope slightly returning. \"And I am very much loved by my husband Rockman. And we'll get through this together.\" she reaches out a hand to help him up. \"What about you? What's your truth?\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T07:43:46.597000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743374225552834652","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"My truth?\" He pauses for a few moments. He takes her hand \"my name is Rockman, creation of Ebuc. A knight of the order, if they will still have me... I am inadequate and have flaws, nonenof which seem to bother my wife Leaf. The love of what life I have.\" He embraces her and sobs","created_at":"2020-08-13T07:49:52.986000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743375762299813889","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
