{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf blinks awake, and stares up at the late morning sky for a moment. She's in blankets? Rooftop? No... That was ages ago... Ages ago... Yesterday.... Rock. War. Golden Dawn. Gil. Mello. Leaf sits up from her blankets with a panicked gasp.","created_at":"2020-08-13T18:12:56.351000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743532559496904766","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
