{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"(Sorry was afk)","created_at":"2020-08-13T18:40:26.301000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743539479888789524","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"Rock- you're still-\" she hugs him tightly. \"Please, please don't let them get you, please. I can't loose you too. Not to them.\" She practically buries herself in him","created_at":"2020-08-13T18:47:40.632000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743541301605040148","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"Them? Who are you talking about?\" He smiles as he holds her","created_at":"2020-08-13T18:53:06.407000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743542668004556899","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"The... The Golden Dawn.\" Leaf says it quietly. She's scared to say it. Words give things power, and she doesn't want to give them *anything*.","created_at":"2020-08-13T18:56:26.693000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743543508065058907","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"He looks at her confused \"Who are they? You mentioned the golden dawn last night.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T18:57:52.384000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-13T18:59:02.921000Z","id":"743543867479031816","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"I- I don't know a whole lot...\" She takes both of his hands tightly. \"Their leader's name is Solomon. I don't know exactly what he wants other than great power, and that he doesn't care who he or his members hurt to get it.\" She shivers \"They... They were doing things on the sub. Snuck something on. They were trying to get something from an underwater temple I think. And a contract with fiend. At one point, I- I don't know how or why... But Ebuc was involved somehow. He was really close with Goanhawe, who seamed to be at the center of everything bad happening. Daysong saw that Ebuc was in trouble and asked me to talk to him. I- I did my best but I never asked him outright. I was too scared. But- but if they'd never gotten to him, he wouldn't have felt the need to... To...\" She shakes her head. \"The point is, they work through secrets and lies and fear. A few people have had their memories taken away. A- and Rock,\" she looks him in the eyes, tears welling over, \"Rock, all the people involved with them. As far as I know, they're all either dead or cursed. Please- I- I can't-\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T19:26:27.595000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-13T19:28:53.700000Z","id":"743551061595258932","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"He grabs her quickly \"Leaf, we're going to get through this. I promise.\" He embraces her... \"Ebuc, I've heard a few stories about my creator... But I fail to see how such a soul could be willing to go through what you say willingly.\" He pauses thinking on what she had said. \"What did he feel the need to do? Was it good or bad?\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T19:34:12.235000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743553010436931585","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"I- I don't know. I wasn't there... Web said he regretted what he'd done... Whatever it was. That's why... They went through a door on the sub to fight something. It never opened again. From what I've heard, It... Was basically a suicide mission. A last ditch effort to redeem himself.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T19:45:33.754000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743555868934537226","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
