{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Rockman nods \"if redemption was attempted, and all the stories ive heard were true... Then you brought out the best in him. You have a kind soul and should not have regrets.\" He wipes tears of her face and kisses her forhead. \"As long as I am by your side, I swear that I'll be there for you and do my best to make sure you have the courage to pull through.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T19:55:22.419000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743558337974632449","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"Rock, I'm so scared. I need you to be careful. At the first sign of... Of memories being gone or your cloak dimming or things like with the goggles, you need to tell someone. If I'm not around, then maybe Florian. Please. I love you so much. They can't get you. They can't.\" She hugs him tightly.","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:02:50.631000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743560217912016927","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"I will... I promise\" he continues to hug her. Rush barks happily at the two and dashes over, nuzzeling Leaf. A thud is heard on the other side of them as Treble drops down and snarls lightly. \"I won't let our family fall\" (excluding the drop bear in that statement as he is used for catapult so is always falling lol)","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:08:22.766000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743561610987307160","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf smiles \"Thank you Rock. You too Rush.\" She lets out a small laugh. (I have to do run some errands, so I won't be back till later today :/)","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:11:08.566000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743562306402648115","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
