{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Rockman stands and looks to the town. \"There are a few things I need to do today. Come find me when you need me ok?\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:12:39.302000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743562686977015920","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"He climbs down the rope and starts to walk to town. He stops. \"No, Rush should stay with her today.\" He turns back and calls out \"Rush, keep her safe ok?\" Rush responds with a bark and a wagging tail before turning back to Leaf.\n\n(Just state that rush follows you and @me so I can rp rush for you if you want... Whenever you leave from here.)\n\nRockman walks to the town","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:19:32.869000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743564421602869280","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"At one point while she was sitting, Leaf went into her tree and pulled out a small box. The box Ebuc had given her his final items in. She opens it and pulls out a stack of folded papers. She begins looking them over and adding small notes to them. An underline here and there. A few small doodles of flowers. She looks them over and sighs.","created_at":"2020-08-13T22:16:31.073000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743593858083979364","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"After a bit of writing, Leaf carefully folds the notes up and places them back in the box. She adds a new paper to the top of the stack, to make sure it's read first. Next she takes a few seeds and flower buds out of her pocket. They delicately sprout and bloom with a soft glow. Leaf smiles. At least that hasn't changed. She arranges the flowers inside the box before closing it. She picks it up and kneels in front of Rush. \"Rush, if something happens to me... If I... If I die, Rockman needs to find this. He'll need it. Understand?\" She holds the box up to him to sniff. <@456226577798135808>","created_at":"2020-08-13T22:23:32.945000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743595627543527434","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Rush sniffs the box and barks","created_at":"2020-08-13T22:24:55.637000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743595974378651748","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"She pets his head \"Thank you Rush. Here,\" she motions for him to look down from the platform into the inside of the tree. Along the hollow insides are shelves created by the natural growth. She places the box carefully to one closest to the platform, so Rock can reach if he has too. \"I hope he won't need it. We just got married. But, I'm somehow less scared of dying, and more scared of what will happen to him if I do.\" She sighs. \"You and the others will have to be there for him. Make sure he talks to people, ok?\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T22:30:09.208000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-13T22:31:28.839000Z","id":"743597289590751304","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
